# hold SEQ and press OCT+ / OCT- on Steps: the pattern's notes an octave up or down; one undo; not a kit
wait 300
notes 2 1 1 1 100 C3 E3 G3
notes 2 1 9 1 90 G2
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap SEQ
expect page Steps
press SEQ
tap OCT+
release SEQ
expect note 2 1 1 60
expect note 2 1 9 55
expect page Steps
press SEQ
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
release SEQ
expect note 2 1 1 36
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect note 2 1 1 48
# a kit: nothing moves
turn ALGO -1
expect trk 1
listen
press SEQ
tap OCT+
release SEQ
said NO OCTAVES
